# Cruelclaw's Heist promising its gift: Bot2 draws a card first (an Island, CR 702.174j), then reveals its hand (six
# Islands, a seventh drawn, and a Lightning Bolt). Bot1 may not choose a land (the refusal; the Bolt is the positive
# control on the next line), exiles the Bolt, and may cast it for as long as it stays exiled with mana of any type: the
# Mox Pearl's white mana pays the {R}. The Bolt hits Bot2 (17) and, cast from exile, goes to its owner's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Cruelclaw's Heist
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cruelclaw's Heist.Cast
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile = Lightning Bolt
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Cruelclaw's Heist
